  "description": "When ordinary man Moo-Yeong awakens as an A-rank guide, he is shocked to find out he has been paired with his long-lost first love from high school: the elite S-rank esper Yoo-Hae. Although Yoo-Hae is delighted about their reunion, Moo-Yeong is determined to keep their relationship a professional one. And thus begins an endless amount of “work” as a guide. While it’s standard protocol for guides to heal through physical intimacy, Yoo-Hae’s demands are obsessively intense, pushing Moo-Yeong to his limits. Is this so-called business relationship going to work out?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's OOTD Danpyeonseon (OOTD 단편선) Collection.*",
